        "description": "Electromyography showing denervation consistent with motor neuron disease",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      },
      {
        "id": "absence-of-sensory-neuropathy",
        "description": "Lack of sensory nerve involvement on nerve conduction studies",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of early-onset respiratory distress, distal muscle weakness, and pathogenic IGHMBP2 mutation",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is confirmed by genetic testing; clinical features and electrophysiology support diagnosis."
